{
	"id": "mask",
	"name": "Mask of Tutankhamun",
	"plural": "masks of Tutankhamun",
	"meaning": "The gold mask laid over the head of Tutankhamun’s mummy, inlaid with blue glass and stones. Howard Carter’s team found it in the king’s tomb in the Valley of the Kings in 1925."
